+    /* =====================================================================
+     * DGMenu – a dependency-free, accessible menu component.
+     *
+     * Features
+     *  - Multi-level nested submenus (any depth) driven by a plain data model
+     *  - Item types: link, action, checkbox, radio (grouped), separator, heading
