+     *  - Keyboard: Arrow keys, Home/End, Enter/Space, Escape, Tab, type-ahead
+     *  - Menubar mode: Left/Right arrows move between adjacent nav menus
+     *  - Viewport-aware positioning (flips left / aligns end / shifts up)
+     *  - Compact layout (<= 760px): submenus stack inline like an accordion
+     * ===================================================================== */
